# evroc Provider

Manage evroc infrastructure with Terraform or OpenTofu. Configure a default
project and region through the provider or your authenticated evroc CLI config.
Regional KMS keys and console-log lookups use the provider region; use provider
aliases for multiple regions.

```terraform
terraform {
  required_providers {
    evroc = {
      source  = "evroc-oss/evroc"
      version = "~> 0.10.0"
    }
  }
}

provider "evroc" {
  project = "my-project"
  region  = "se-sto"
}
```

Use RS256 JWT service-account credentials to authenticate the provider.
HMAC-SigV4 credentials created by `evroc_service_account_credential` are for
services accepting AWS Signature V4; they cannot replace the provider's JWK
credential. Credential secrets and console-log data are stored in Terraform
state even when marked sensitive.

